    "# YouTube ETL Pipeline for Artist Video Data\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook extracts YouTube video data for multiple artists, including view counts, statistics, and metadata. The pipeline:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Extract**: Uses YouTube Data API to get channel videos and statistics\n",
    "2. **Transform**: Processes and cleans the data using existing helpers\n",
    "3. **Load**: Stores data in MySQL database with proper relationships\n",
    "\n",
    "## Features\n",
    "- Multi-artist support with configurable channels\n",
    "- Comprehensive error handling and logging\n",
    "- Database guard for safe operations\n",
    "- Caching to minimize API calls\n",
    "- Progress tracking and resume capability\n",
    "- Batch processing for efficiency"
   ]
  },
